msgid "Authoring a native binding"
msgstr "네이티브 바인딩 작성"

#: src/native-libraries/authoring-guide.md:3
msgid ""
"Step-by-step guide to writing and publishing a Rust binding that Perry "
"programs can `import` like any npm package."
msgstr ""
"Perry 프로그램이 어떤 npm 패키지처럼 `import`할 수 있는 Rust 바인딩을 작성하"
"고 게시하는 단계별 가이드."

#: src/native-libraries/authoring-guide.md:6
msgid ""
"For the architectural picture this fits into, see [Native bindings — "
"overview](overview.md)."
msgstr ""
"이것이 들어맞는 아키텍처 그림에 대해서는 [Native bindings — overview]"
"(overview.md)를 참조하세요."

#: src/native-libraries/authoring-guide.md:11
msgid ""
"A Rust crate you want to expose to TypeScript (e.g. `pdfium-render`, "
"`image`, your own internal library)."
msgstr ""
"TypeScript에 노출하고 싶은 Rust 크레이트 (예: `pdfium-render`, `image`, 자신"
"의 내부 라이브러리)."

#: src/native-libraries/authoring-guide.md:13
msgid "Rust toolchain installed."
msgstr "Rust 툴체인이 설치됨."

#: src/native-libraries/authoring-guide.md:14
msgid ""
"`perry` on your `PATH` (the [`perry native`](../cli/commands.md#native) "
"subcommand ships with the install)."
msgstr ""
"`perry`를 `PATH`에 설치하세요 (설치된 [`perry native`](../cli/"
"commands.md#native) 하위 명령어)"

#: src/native-libraries/authoring-guide.md:16
msgid ""
"A GitHub account if you want the prebuild release-CI scaffold to Just Work."
msgstr "사전 빌드 릴리스 CI 스캐폴드가 그냥 작동하기를 원한다면 GitHub 계정."

#: src/native-libraries/authoring-guide.md:19
msgid "1. Scaffold"
msgstr "1. 스캐폴드"

#: src/native-libraries/authoring-guide.md:23
