#: src/ui/widgets.md:3
msgid ""
"Perry provides native widgets that map to each platform's native controls. "
"Every example on this page is a real runnable program verified by CI "
"(`scripts/run_doc_tests.sh`) — the snippet you read is the same source "
"that's compiled and launched."
msgstr ""
"Perry는 각 플랫폼의 네이티브 컨트롤에 매핑되는 네이티브 위젯을 제공합니다. "
"이 페이지의 모든 예시는 CI (`scripts/run_doc_tests.sh`)에 의해 검증된 실제 실"
"행 가능한 프로그램입니다 — 읽고 있는 스니펫은 컴파일되어 시작되는 같은 소스입"
"니다."

#: src/ui/widgets.md:8
msgid ""
"Most widget operations use **free functions**. A widget is a 64-bit opaque "
"handle; pass it into helpers like `textSetFontSize(widget, 18)` rather than "
"calling `widget.setFontSize(18)`. The small method surface declared by "
"`WidgetMethods` is cross-backend too: it includes animations plus "
"`parent.addChild(child)` and `parent.removeAllChildren()` compatibility "
"aliases for `widgetAddChild` and `widgetClearChildren`."
msgstr ""
"대부분의 위젯 작업은 **자유 함수**. 위젯은 64비트 불투명한 핸들입니다. "
"`widget.setFontSize(18)`를 호출하는 대신 `textSetFontSize(widget, 18)`와 같"
"은 보조에 전달하십시오. `WidgetMethods`에 의해 선언된 작은 메소드 표면은 또"
"한 크로스 백엔드입니다: 그것은 `widgetAddChild`와 `widgetClearChildren`에 대"
"한 `parent.addChild(child)`와 `parent.removeAllChildren()` 호환성 별명과 함"
"께 애니메이션을 포함합니다."

#: src/ui/widgets.md:17
msgid "Displays read-only text."
msgstr "읽기 전용 텍스트를 표시합니다."

#: src/ui/widgets.md:19
msgid ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"// demonstrates: Text widget styling with the real free-function API\n"
"// docs: docs/src/ui/widgets.md\n"
"// platforms: macos, linux, windows\n"
"// targets: ios-simulator, web, wasm\n"
"\n"
"import { App, VStack, Text, textSetFontSize, textSetFontWeight, "
"textSetColor, textSetFontFamily } from \"perry/ui\"\n"
"\n"
"const label = Text(\"Hello, World!\")\n"
"textSetFontSize(label, 18)\n"
"textSetColor(label, 0.2, 0.2, 0.2, 1.0) // RGBA in [0, 1]\n"
"textSetFontFamily(label, \"Menlo\")\n"
"\n"
"const bold = Text(\"Bold\")\n"
"textSetFontWeight(bold, 20, 1.0)\n"
"\n"
"App({\n"
"    title: \"Text\",\n"
"    width: 400,\n"
"    height: 200,\n"
"    body: VStack(8, [label, bold]),\n"
"})\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"// demonstrates: Text widget styling with the real free-function API\n"
"// docs: docs/src/ui/widgets.md\n"
"// platforms: macos, linux, windows\n"
"// targets: ios-simulator, web, wasm\n"
"\n"
"import { App, VStack, Text, textSetFontSize, textSetFontWeight, "
"textSetColor, textSetFontFamily } from \"perry/ui\"\n"
"\n"
"const label = Text(\"Hello, World!\")\n"
"textSetFontSize(label, 18)\n"
"textSetColor(label, 0.2, 0.2, 0.2, 1.0) // RGBA in [0, 1]\n"
"textSetFontFamily(label, \"Menlo\")\n"
"\n"
"const bold = Text(\"Bold\")\n"
"textSetFontWeight(bold, 20, 1.0)\n"
"\n"
"App({\n"
"    title: \"Text\",\n"
"    width: 400,\n"
"    height: 200,\n"
"    body: VStack(8, [label, bold]),\n"
"})\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:43
msgid ""
"Color is RGBA with each channel in `[0.0, 1.0]` — divide a hex byte by 255 "
"(`0x33 / 255 ≈ 0.2`)."
msgstr ""
"색상은 RGBA이며 각 채널은 `[0.0, 1.0]` 범위입니다 — 16진수 바이트를 255로 나"
"누세요 (`0x33 / 255 ≈ 0.2`)."

#: src/ui/widgets.md:46
msgid ""
"**Helpers:** `textSetString`, `textSetFontSize`, `textSetFontWeight`, "
"`textSetFontFamily`, `textSetColor`, `textSetWraps`, `textSetSelectable`."
msgstr ""
"**헬퍼:** `textSetString`, `textSetFontSize`, `textSetFontWeight`, "
"`textSetFontFamily`, `textSetColor`, `textSetWraps`, `textSetSelectable`."

#: src/ui/widgets.md:49
msgid ""
"Text widgets inside template literals with `state.value` update "
"automatically — perry detects the state read and rewires the widget to re-"
"render on change. See [State Management](state.md)."
msgstr ""
"`state.value`가 있는 템플릿 리터럴 내의 텍스트 위젯은 자동으로 업데이트됩니"
"다 — perry는 상태 읽기를 감지하고 변경 시 다시 렌더링하도록 위젯을 다시 배선"
"합니다. [State Management](state.md)를 참조하세요."

