"Every snippet below is excerpted from [`docs/examples/ui/state/snippets.ts`]"
"(../../examples/ui/state/snippets.ts) — CI compiles and runs it on every PR."
msgstr ""
"Perry는 데이터가 변경될 때 UI를 자동으로 업데이트하기 위해 반응형 상태를 사용"
"합니다. 아래의 모든 스니펫은 [`docs/examples/ui/state/snippets.ts`](../../"
"examples/ui/state/snippets.ts)에서 발췌되었습니다 — CI는 모든 PR에서 그것을 "
"컴파일하고 실행합니다."

#: src/ui/state.md:8
msgid "Creating State"
msgstr "상태 만들기"

#: src/ui/state.md:10
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const counter = State(0)               // number state\n"
"const username = State(\"Perry\")        // string state\n"
"const items = State<string[]>([])      // array state\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const counter = State(0)               // number state\n"
"const username = State(\"Perry\")        // string state\n"
"const items = State<string[]>([])      // array state\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/state.md:16
msgid "`State(initialValue)` creates a reactive state container."
msgstr "`State(initialValue)`는 반응형 상태 컨테이너를 만듭니다."

#: src/ui/state.md:18
msgid "Reading and Writing"
msgstr "읽기와 쓰기"

#: src/ui/state.md:20
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const value = counter.value     // Read current value\n"
"counter.set(42)                  // Set new value → triggers UI update\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const value = counter.value     // Read current value\n"
"counter.set(42)                  // Set new value → triggers UI update\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/state.md:25
msgid "Every `.set()` call re-renders the widget tree with the new value."
msgstr "모든 `.set()` 호출은 새 값으로 위젯 트리를 다시 렌더링합니다."

#: src/ui/state.md:27
msgid "Reactive Text"
msgstr "반응형 텍스트"

#: src/ui/state.md:29
msgid "Template literals with `state.value` update automatically:"
msgstr "`state.value`가 있는 템플릿 리터럴은 자동으로 업데이트됩니다:"

#: src/ui/state.md:31
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const showCount = State(0)\n"
"const countLabel = Text(`Count: ${showCount.value}`)\n"
"// The text updates whenever showCount changes.\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const showCount = State(0)\n"
"const countLabel = Text(`Count: ${showCount.value}`)\n"
"// The text updates whenever showCount changes.\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/state.md:37
msgid ""
"This works because Perry detects `state.value` reads inside template "
"literals and creates reactive bindings."
msgstr ""
"이는 Perry가 템플릿 리터럴 내의 `state.value` 읽기를 감지하고 반응형 바인딩"
"을 만들기 때문에 작동합니다."

#: src/ui/state.md:40
msgid "Binding Inputs to State"
msgstr "입력을 상태에 바인딩"

#: src/ui/state.md:42
msgid ""
"Input widgets expose an `onChange` callback. Forward that into a state's "
"`.set(...)` to keep the state in sync as the user types/toggles/drags:"
msgstr ""
"입력 위젯은 `onChange` 콜백을 노출합니다. 사용자가 입력하거나/토글하거나/드래"
"그할 때 상태를 동기화 상태로 유지하기 위해 그것을 상태의 `.set(...)`에 전달하"
"세요:"

#: src/ui/state.md:45
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const input = State(\"\")\n"
"const field = TextField(\"Type here...\", (v: string) => input.set(v))\n"
"\n"
"// Optional: also let input.set(\"hello\") update the field on screen.\n"
"stateBindTextfield(input, field)\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const input = State(\"\")\n"
"const field = TextField(\"Type here...\", (v: string) => input.set(v))\n"
"\n"
"// Optional: also let input.set(\"hello\") update the field on screen.\n"
"stateBindTextfield(input, field)\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/state.md:53
msgid "Input control signatures:"
msgstr "입력 컨트롤 시그니처:"

#: src/ui/state.md:54
msgid ""
"`TextField(placeholder, onChange)` — text input, `onChange: (value: string) "
"=> void`"
msgstr ""
"`TextField(placeholder, onChange)` — 텍스트 입력, `onChange: (value: string) "
"=> void`"

#: src/ui/state.md:55
msgid ""
"`SecureField(placeholder, onChange)` — password input, `onChange: (value: "
"string) => void`"
msgstr ""
"`SecureField(placeholder, onChange)` — 비밀번호 입력, `onChange: (value: "
"string) => void`"

#: src/ui/state.md:56
msgid ""
"`Toggle(label, onChange)` — boolean toggle, `onChange: (value: boolean) => "
"void`"
msgstr ""
"`Toggle(label, onChange)` — boolean 토글, `onChange: (value: boolean) => "
"void`"

#: src/ui/state.md:57
msgid ""
"`Slider(min, max, onChange)` — numeric slider, `onChange: (value: number) => "
"void`"
msgstr ""
"`Slider(min, max, onChange)` — 수치 슬라이더, `onChange: (value: number) => "
"void`"

#: src/ui/state.md:58
msgid ""
"`Picker(onChange)` — dropdown, `onChange: (index: number) => void`; items "
"via `pickerAddItem`"
msgstr ""
"`Picker(onChange)` — 드롭다운, `onChange: (index: number) => void`; 항목은 "
"`pickerAddItem`을 통해"

#: src/ui/state.md:59
msgid ""
"`WheelPicker(onChange)` — spinning selector on touch platforms and a "
"scrollable selector elsewhere; items via `wheelPickerAddItem`"
msgstr ""
"`WheelPicker(onChange)`  터치 플랫폼에서 회전 선택기와 다른 곳에서 스크롤 가"
"능한 선택기; `wheelPickerAddItem`를 통한 항목"

#: src/ui/state.md:61
msgid ""
"For programmatic-to-UI sync (state-drives-widget) use the dedicated binders: "
"`stateBindTextfield`, `stateBindSlider`, `stateBindToggle`, "
"`stateBindTextNumeric`, `stateBindVisibility`."
msgstr ""
"프로그램에서 UI로의 동기화 (상태가 위젯을 구동)에는 전용 바인더를 사용하세"
"요: `stateBindTextfield`, `stateBindSlider`, `stateBindToggle`, "
"`stateBindTextNumeric`, `stateBindVisibility`."

#: src/ui/state.md:65
msgid "onChange Callbacks"
msgstr "onChange 콜백"

#: src/ui/state.md:67
msgid "Listen for state changes with the free-function `stateOnChange`:"
msgstr "자유 함수 `stateOnChange`로 상태 변경을 수신합니다:"

#: src/ui/state.md:76 src/widgets/components.md:89 src/widgets/platforms.md:32
msgid "ForEach"
msgstr "ForEach"

#: src/ui/state.md:78
msgid "Render a list from numeric state (the index count):"
msgstr "수치 상태 (인덱스 카운트)에서 목록을 렌더링합니다:"

#: src/ui/state.md:80
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const fruits = State([\"Apple\", \"Banana\", \"Cherry\"])\n"
"const fruitCount = State(3)\n"
"\n"
"const fruitList = VStack(16, [\n"
"    ForEach(fruitCount, (i: number) =>\n"
"        Text(`${i + 1}. ${fruits.value[i]}`),\n"
"    ),\n"
"])\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const fruits = State([\"Apple\", \"Banana\", \"Cherry\"])\n"
"const fruitCount = State(3)\n"
"\n"
"const fruitList = VStack(16, [\n"
"    ForEach(fruitCount, (i: number) =>\n"
"        Text(`${i + 1}. ${fruits.value[i]}`),\n"
"    ),\n"
"])\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/state.md:91
msgid ""
"**Note:** `ForEach` iterates by index over a numeric state. Keep a count "
"state in sync with your array, then read the items via `array.value[i]` "
"inside the closure."
msgstr ""
"**참고:** `ForEach`는 수치 상태에 대해 인덱스로 반복합니다. 배열과 동기화된 "
"카운트 상태를 유지한 다음, 클로저 내에서 `array.value[i]`를 통해 항목을 읽으"
"세요."

#: src/ui/state.md:95
msgid "`ForEach` re-renders the list when the count state changes:"
msgstr "카운트 상태가 변경될 때 `ForEach`는 목록을 다시 렌더링합니다:"

#: src/ui/state.md:97
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"// Add an item:\n"
"fruits.set([...fruits.value, \"Date\"])\n"
"fruitCount.set(fruitCount.value + 1)\n"
"\n"
"// Remove an item:\n"
"fruits.set(fruits.value.filter((_, i) => i !== 1))\n"
"fruitCount.set(fruitCount.value - 1)\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"// Add an item:\n"
"fruits.set([...fruits.value, \"Date\"])\n"
"fruitCount.set(fruitCount.value + 1)\n"
"\n"
"// Remove an item:\n"
"fruits.set(fruits.value.filter((_, i) => i !== 1))\n"
"fruitCount.set(fruitCount.value - 1)\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/state.md:107
msgid "Conditional Rendering"
msgstr "조건부 렌더링"

#: src/ui/state.md:109
msgid "Use state to conditionally show widgets:"
msgstr "위젯을 조건부로 보여주기 위해 상태를 사용합니다:"

#: src/ui/state.md:111
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const showDetails = State(false)\n"
"const detailsLabel: number = showDetails.value\n"
"    ? Text(\"Details are visible!\")\n"
"    : Spacer()\n"
"const detailsPanel = VStack(16, [\n"
"    Button(\"Toggle\", () => showDetails.set(!showDetails.value)),\n"
"    detailsLabel,\n"
"])\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const showDetails = State(false)\n"
"const detailsLabel: number = showDetails.value\n"
"    ? Text(\"Details are visible!\")\n"
"    : Spacer()\n"
"const detailsPanel = VStack(16, [\n"
"    Button(\"Toggle\", () => showDetails.set(!showDetails.value)),\n"
"    detailsLabel,\n"
"])\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/state.md:122
msgid "Multi-State Text"
msgstr "다중 상태 텍스트"

#: src/ui/state.md:124
msgid "Text can depend on multiple state values:"
msgstr "텍스트는 여러 상태 값에 의존할 수 있습니다:"

#: src/ui/state.md:126
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const firstName = State(\"John\")\n"
"const lastName = State(\"Doe\")\n"
"\n"
"const greeting = Text(`Hello, ${firstName.value} ${lastName.value}!`)\n"
"// Updates when either firstName or lastName changes.\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const firstName = State(\"John\")\n"
"const lastName = State(\"Doe\")\n"
"\n"
"const greeting = Text(`Hello, ${firstName.value} ${lastName.value}!`)\n"
"// Updates when either firstName or lastName changes.\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/state.md:134
msgid "State with Objects and Arrays"
msgstr "객체와 배열을 가진 상태"

#: src/ui/state.md:136
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const user = State({ name: \"Perry\", age: 0 })\n"
"\n"
"// Update by replacing the whole object:\n"
"user.set({ ...user.value, age: 1 })\n"
"\n"
"const todos = State<{ text: string; done: boolean }[]>([])\n"
"\n"
"// Add a todo:\n"
"todos.set([...todos.value, { text: \"New task\", done: false }])\n"
"\n"
"// Toggle a todo (must produce a new array reference):\n"
"const next = todos.value.slice()\n"
"if (next.length > 0) {\n"
"    next[0] = { ...next[0], done: !next[0].done }\n"
"    todos.set(next)\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const user = State({ name: \"Perry\", age: 0 })\n"
"\n"
"// Update by replacing the whole object:\n"
"user.set({ ...user.value, age: 1 })\n"
"\n"
"const todos = State<{ text: string; done: boolean }[]>([])\n"
"\n"
"// Add a todo:\n"
"todos.set([...todos.value, { text: \"New task\", done: false }])\n"
"\n"
"// Toggle a todo (must produce a new array reference):\n"
"const next = todos.value.slice()\n"
"if (next.length > 0) {\n"
"    next[0] = { ...next[0], done: !next[0].done }\n"
"    todos.set(next)\n"
"}\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/state.md:155
msgid ""
"**Note**: State uses identity comparison. You must create a new array/object "
"reference for changes to be detected. Mutating in-place without calling "
"`.set()` with a new reference won't trigger updates."
msgstr ""
"**참고**: 상태는 identity 비교를 사용합니다. 변경이 감지되도록 새로운 배열/객"
"체 참조를 만들어야 합니다. 새 참조와 함께 `.set()`을 호출하지 않고 in-place"
"로 변경하면 업데이트가 트리거되지 않습니다."

#: src/ui/state.md:159 src/ui/events.md:113 src/ui/table.md:73
#: src/widgets/components.md:214
msgid "Complete Example"
msgstr "완전한 예시"

#: src/ui/state.md:222
msgid ""
"This program is built and run by CI (`scripts/run_doc_tests.sh`), so the "
"snippet above always matches the compiled artifact under [`docs/examples/ui/"
"state/todo_app.ts`](../../examples/ui/state/todo_app.ts)."
msgstr ""
"이 프로그램은 CI (`scripts/run_doc_tests.sh`)에 의해 빌드되고 실행됩니다. 그"
"래서 위의 스니펫은 항상 [`docs/examples/ui/state/todo_app.ts`](../../"
"examples/ui/state/todo_app.ts) 아래의 컴파일된 아티팩트와 일치합니다."

#: src/ui/state.md:228
msgid "[Events](events.md) — Click, hover, keyboard events"
msgstr "[Events](events.md) — 클릭, 호버, 키보드 이벤트"

#: src/ui/events.md:3
msgid ""
"Perry widgets support native event handlers for user interaction. Every "
"snippet below is excerpted from [`docs/examples/ui/events/snippets.ts`]"
"(../../examples/ui/events/snippets.ts) — CI compiles and runs it on every "
"PR, so the API drawn here is the API the runtime exposes."
msgstr ""
"Perry 위젯은 사용자 상호작용을 위한 네이티브 이벤트 핸들러를 지원합니다. 아래"
"의 모든 스니펫은 [`docs/examples/ui/events/snippets.ts`](../../examples/ui/"
"events/snippets.ts)에서 발췌되었습니다 — CI는 모든 PR에서 그것을 컴파일하고 "
"실행하므로, 여기에 그려진 API는 런타임이 노출하는 API입니다."

#: src/ui/events.md:9
msgid ""
"Event handlers are registered as **free functions** that take the widget "
"handle as the first argument. The widget handle itself is opaque (`number` "
"at the type level); perry's API is function-first throughout."
msgstr ""
"이벤트 핸들러는 위젯 핸들을 첫 번째 인수로 받는 **자유 함수** 로 등록됩니다. "
"위젯 핸들 자체는 불투명합니다 (타입 수준에서 `number`); perry의 API는 처음부"
"터 끝까지 함수 우선입니다."

#: src/ui/events.md:13 src/testing/geisterhand.md:100
msgid "onClick"
msgstr "onClick"

#: src/ui/events.md:15
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const greet = Button(\"Click me\", () => {\n"
"    log.set(\"Button clicked\")\n"
"})\n"
"\n"
"// Or attach a click handler to a non-button widget after creation:\n"
"const label = Text(\"Clickable text\")\n"
"widgetSetOnClick(label, () => {\n"
"    log.set(\"Text clicked\")\n"
"})\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const greet = Button(\"Click me\", () => {\n"
"    log.set(\"Button clicked\")\n"
"})\n"
"\n"
"// Or attach a click handler to a non-button widget after creation:\n"
"const label = Text(\"Clickable text\")\n"
"widgetSetOnClick(label, () => {\n"
"    log.set(\"Text clicked\")\n"
"})\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/events.md:27 src/testing/geisterhand.md:103
msgid "onHover"
msgstr "onHover"

#: src/ui/events.md:29
msgid "Triggered when the cursor enters the widget."
msgstr "커서가 위젯에 들어갈 때 트리거됩니다."

#: src/ui/events.md:31
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const hoverBtn = Button(\"Hover me\", () => {})\n"
"widgetSetOnHover(hoverBtn, () => {\n"
"    log.set(\"hovered\")\n"
"})\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const hoverBtn = Button(\"Hover me\", () => {})\n"
"widgetSetOnHover(hoverBtn, () => {\n"
"    log.set(\"hovered\")\n"
"})\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/events.md:38
msgid ""
"**Note**: Hover events are available on macOS, Windows, Linux, and Web. iOS "
"and Android use touch interactions instead. The callback fires once on "
"enter; if you need a \"left\" event you'll have to track it yourself."
msgstr ""
"**참고**: 호버 이벤트는 macOS, Windows, Linux, Web에서 사용 가능합니다. iOS"
"와 Android는 대신 터치 상호작용을 사용합니다. 콜백은 enter 시 한 번 발생합니"
"다; \"left\" 이벤트가 필요하다면 직접 추적해야 합니다."

#: src/ui/events.md:42 src/testing/geisterhand.md:104
msgid "onDoubleClick"
msgstr "onDoubleClick"

#: src/ui/events.md:44
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const dbl = Text(\"Double-click me\")\n"
"widgetSetOnDoubleClick(dbl, () => {\n"
"    log.set(\"double-clicked!\")\n"
"})\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const dbl = Text(\"Double-click me\")\n"
"widgetSetOnDoubleClick(dbl, () => {\n"
"    log.set(\"double-clicked!\")\n"
"})\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/events.md:51 src/ui/menus.md:64
msgid "Keyboard Shortcuts"
msgstr "키보드 단축키"

#: src/ui/events.md:53
msgid "Register in-app keyboard shortcuts (active when the app is focused):"
msgstr "앱 내 키보드 단축키를 등록합니다 (앱이 포커스되어 있을 때 활성):"

#: src/ui/events.md:55
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"// Cmd+N on macOS, Ctrl+N on other platforms (modifier 1 = Cmd/Ctrl).\n"
"addKeyboardShortcut(\"n\", 1, () => {\n"
"    log.set(\"New document\")\n"
"})\n"
"\n"
"// Cmd+Shift+S — modifiers add: 1 (Cmd/Ctrl) + 2 (Shift) = 3.\n"
"addKeyboardShortcut(\"s\", 3, () => {\n"
"    log.set(\"Save as...\")\n"
"})\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"// Cmd+N on macOS, Ctrl+N on other platforms (modifier 1 = Cmd/Ctrl).\n"
"addKeyboardShortcut(\"n\", 1, () => {\n"
"    log.set(\"New document\")\n"
"})\n"
"\n"
"// Cmd+Shift+S — modifiers add: 1 (Cmd/Ctrl) + 2 (Shift) = 3.\n"
"addKeyboardShortcut(\"s\", 3, () => {\n"
"    log.set(\"Save as...\")\n"
"})\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/events.md:67
msgid ""
"**Modifier bits:** `1` = Cmd (macOS) / Ctrl (Windows/Linux), `2` = Shift, "
"`4` = Option (macOS) / Alt (others), `8` = Control (macOS only). Combine by "
"adding — `3` = Cmd+Shift, `5` = Cmd+Option, etc."
msgstr ""
"**수정자 비트:** `1` = Cmd (macOS) / Ctrl (Windows/Linux), `2` = Shift, `4` "
"= Option (macOS) / Alt (기타), `8` = Control (macOS 전용). 더해서 결합하세요 "
"— `3` = Cmd+Shift, `5` = Cmd+Option 등."

#: src/ui/events.md:71
msgid "Keyboard shortcuts are also available on [menu items](menus.md):"
msgstr "키보드 단축키는 [메뉴 항목](menus.md)에서도 사용 가능합니다:"

#: src/ui/events.md:73
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const fileMenu = menuCreate()\n"
"menuAddItem(fileMenu, \"New\", () => log.set(\"file/new\"))\n"
"menuAddItem(fileMenu, \"Save As\", () => log.set(\"file/saveAs\"))\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const fileMenu = menuCreate()\n"
"menuAddItem(fileMenu, \"New\", () => log.set(\"file/new\"))\n"
"menuAddItem(fileMenu, \"Save As\", () => log.set(\"file/saveAs\"))\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/events.md:79
msgid "Global Hotkeys"
msgstr "글로벌 핫키"

#: src/ui/events.md:81
msgid ""
"Register a hotkey that fires system-wide, even when the app is in the "
"background:"
msgstr ""
"앱이 백그라운드에 있을 때도 시스템 전체에서 발생하는 핫키를 등록합니다:"

#: src/ui/events.md:84
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"// System-wide: fires even when the app is in the background.\n"
"// macOS: real Carbon RegisterEventHotKey. Other platforms: no-op.\n"
"registerGlobalHotkey(\"F5\", 0, () => {\n"
"    log.set(\"Global F5 hotkey fired\")\n"
"})\n"
"\n"
"// Cmd+Shift+G (modifiers: 1=Cmd + 2=Shift = 3)\n"
"registerGlobalHotkey(\"g\", 3, () => {\n"
"    log.set(\"Global Cmd+Shift+G fired\")\n"
"})\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"// System-wide: fires even when the app is in the background.\n"
"// macOS: real Carbon RegisterEventHotKey. Other platforms: no-op.\n"
"registerGlobalHotkey(\"F5\", 0, () => {\n"
"    log.set(\"Global F5 hotkey fired\")\n"
"})\n"
"\n"
"// Cmd+Shift+G (modifiers: 1=Cmd + 2=Shift = 3)\n"
"registerGlobalHotkey(\"g\", 3, () => {\n"
"    log.set(\"Global Cmd+Shift+G fired\")\n"
"})\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/events.md:97
msgid ""
"**Platform support:** macOS uses Carbon `RegisterEventHotKey` (real "
"implementation). Linux, Windows, iOS, tvOS, visionOS, watchOS, and Android "
"log the registration and no-op — global hotkeys on those platforms require "
"OS-level portal / hook APIs that vary per OS."
msgstr ""
"**플랫폼 지원:** macOS는 Carbon `RegisterEventHotKey`를 사용합니다 (실제 구"
"현). Linux, Windows, iOS, tvOS, visionOS, watchOS, Android는 등록을 로그하고 "
"no-op합니다 — 그 플랫폼의 글로벌 핫키는 OS마다 다른 OS 수준의 portal / hook "
"API가 필요합니다."

