"`durationSecs`.\n"
"fading.animateOpacity(1.0, 0.3) // target, durationSeconds\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const fading = Text(\"Fading text\")\n"
"// Animate from the widget's current opacity to `target` over "
"`durationSecs`.\n"
