"building launcher-style, overlay, or utility apps:"
msgstr ""
"메인 `App({})` 구성 객체는 런처 스타일, 오버레이 또는 유틸리티 앱을 빌드하기 "
"위해 같은 창 속성을 받습니다:"

#: src/ui/multi-window.md:50
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"App({\n"
"    title: \"QuickLaunch\",\n"
"    width: 600,\n"
"    height: 80,\n"
"    frameless: true,             // borderless window, movable by "
"background\n"
"    level: \"floating\",           // stays above normal windows\n"
"    transparent: true,           // desktop shows through non-opaque "
"regions\n"
"    vibrancy: \"sidebar\",         // native translucent background "
"material\n"
"    activationPolicy: \"accessory\", // no dock icon — launcher-style app\n"
"    body: VStack(8, [\n"
"        Text(\"Search...\"),\n"
"        Button(\"Open Settings\", () => settings.show()),\n"
"    ]),\n"
"})\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"App({\n"
"    title: \"QuickLaunch\",\n"
"    width: 600,\n"
"    height: 80,\n"
"    frameless: true,             // borderless window, movable by "
"background\n"
"    level: \"floating\",           // stays above normal windows\n"
"    transparent: true,           // desktop shows through non-opaque "
"regions\n"
"    vibrancy: \"sidebar\",         // native translucent background "
"material\n"
"    activationPolicy: \"accessory\", // no dock icon — launcher-style app\n"
"    body: VStack(8, [\n"
"        Text(\"Search...\"),\n"
"        Button(\"Open Settings\", () => settings.show()),\n"
"    ]),\n"
"})\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/multi-window.md:67
msgid ""
"`App` additionally accepts the optional fields `frameless`, `level`, "
"`transparent`, `vibrancy`, `activationPolicy`, and `icon`. Each present "
"field is applied to the window right after creation — before the body widget "
"is attached, so vibrancy and frameless reconfigure the window ahead of "
"layout. (`activationPolicy` is also settable at runtime via the standalone "
"`appSetActivationPolicy(policy)` function.) They map to the following native "
"primitives:"
msgstr ""
"`App`는 추가로 `frameless`, `level`, `transparent`, `vibrancy`, "
"`activationPolicy`, `icon`의 선택 필드를 허용합니다. 각 현장들은 창을 생성한 "
"직후 창에 적용됩니다. 그래서 생동감과 프레임리스가 레이아웃을 앞두고 창을 재"
"구성합니다. (`activationPolicy`는 독립적인 `appSetActivationPolicy(policy)` "
"함수를 통해 실행 시에도 설정할 수 있습니다.) 그들은 다음 네이티브 프림티브에 "
"매핑합니다:"

