#: src/ui/webview.md:3
msgid ""
"`WebView` embeds a real browser engine inside the native widget tree — "
"`WKWebView` on Apple platforms, `WebView2` on Windows, `WebKitGTK 6.0` on "
"Linux, `android.webkit.WebView` on Android, and a sandboxed `<iframe>` on "
"the web target. Use it for OAuth / payment flows, embedded admin pages, "
"help / docs viewers, or any \"show this URL as part of my app\" surface. The "
"cross-platform implementation shipped under closed issue \\#658."
msgstr ""
"`WebView`는 네이티브 위젯 트리 안에 실제 브라우저 엔진을 내장하고 있습니다.  "
"애플 플랫폼에서 `WKWebView`, Windows에서 `WebView2`, Linux에서 `WebKitGTK "
"6.0`, Android에서 `android.webkit.WebView`, 그리고 웹 타겟에서 샌드박스 "
"`<iframe>`. OAuth / 결제 흐름, 임베디드 관리자 페이지, 도움말 / 문서 시청자 "
"또는 \"내 응용 프로그램의 일부로 이 URL을 표시\"면으로 사용하십시오. 크로스 "
"플랫폼 구현은 닫힌 이슈 \\#658로 배포됩니다."

#: src/ui/webview.md:11
msgid ""
"```ts\n"
"import {\n"
"    WebView,\n"
"    webviewLoadUrl,\n"
"    webviewReload,\n"
"    webviewGoBack,\n"
"    webviewGoForward,\n"
"    webviewCanGoBack,\n"
"    webviewEvaluateJs,\n"
"    webviewClearCookies,\n"
"} from \"perry/ui\"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```ts\n"
"import {\n"
"    WebView,\n"
"    webviewLoadUrl,\n"
"    webviewReload,\n"
"    webviewGoBack,\n"
"    webviewGoForward,\n"
"    webviewCanGoBack,\n"
"    webviewEvaluateJs,\n"
"    webviewClearCookies,\n"
"} from \"perry/ui\"\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/webview.md:24
msgid ""
"**Scope.** This is a \"browser tab embedded in your native widget tree\" "
"primitive — explicit non-goals: a Tauri / Electron-style native↔JS RPC "
"bridge, custom protocol / scheme handlers, DevTools, file downloads, WebGL / "
"camera / mic / clipboard permission negotiation, service workers, WebRTC. If "
"you need any of those, reach for Tauri or Electron; the rest of `perry/ui` "
"still applies."
msgstr ""
"**범위.** 이것은 \"네이티브 위젯 트리에 임베드된 브라우저 탭\" 기본 요소입니"
"다. 명시적인 비목표: Tauri / Electron 스타일의 네이티브 ↔ JS RPC 브리지, 커스"
"텀 프로토콜 / 스킴 핸들러, DevTools, 파일 다운로드, WebGL / 카메라 / 마이"
"크 / 클립보드 권한 협상, 서비스 워커, WebRTC. 이 중 하나가 필요하다면 Tauri"
"나 Electron을 사용하세요. `perry/ui`의 나머지 부분은 여전히 적용됩니다."

#: src/ui/webview.md:33
msgid ""
"```ts\n"
"const wv = WebView({\n"
"    url: \"https://example.com\",\n"
"    width: 800,\n"
"    height: 600,\n"
"})\n"
"\n"
"App({\n"
"    title: \"WebView Demo\",\n"
"    width: 820,\n"
"    height: 640,\n"
"    body: wv,\n"
"})\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```ts\n"
"const wv = WebView({\n"
"    url: \"https://example.com\",\n"
"    width: 800,\n"
"    height: 600,\n"
"})\n"
"\n"
"App({\n"
"    title: \"WebView Demo\",\n"
"    width: 820,\n"
"    height: 640,\n"
"    body: wv,\n"
"})\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/webview.md:48
msgid ""
"`WebView({...})` returns a `Widget` you can drop into any layout container. "
"The widget tree's layout engine controls final size — `width` and `height` "
"are hints for the initial bounds."
msgstr ""
"`WebView({...})`는 레이아웃 컨테이너에 배치할 수 있는 `Widget`을 반환합니다. "
"위젯 트리의 레이아웃 엔진이 최종 크기를 결정하며, `width`와 `height`는 초기 "
"경계에 대한 힌트입니다."

#: src/ui/webview.md:52
msgid "OAuth / Callback Interception"
msgstr "OAuth / 콜백 인터셉트"

#: src/ui/webview.md:54
msgid ""
"The load-bearing use case. `onShouldNavigate` is a **synchronous** intercept "
"invoked before each navigation; return `false` to cancel the load. Every "
"backend's should-load hook is itself sync on the main thread "
"(`decidePolicyForNavigationAction`, `NavigationStarting`, "
"`shouldOverrideUrlLoading`, `decide-policy`), so the contract is the same "
"everywhere."
msgstr ""
"핵심 사용 사례입니다. `onShouldNavigate`는 각 탐색 전에 호출되는 **동기** 인"
"터셉트로, `false`를 반환하면 로드를 취소합니다. 모든 백엔드의 should-load 훅"
"은 메인 스레드에서 동기적으로 동작하므로(`decidePolicyForNavigationAction`, "
"`NavigationStarting`, `shouldOverrideUrlLoading`, `decide-policy`), 동작 계약"
"은 어디서나 동일합니다."

#: src/ui/webview.md:61
msgid ""
"```ts\n"
"const authCode = State(\"\")\n"
"\n"
"const auth = WebView({\n"
"    url: \"https://accounts.google.com/o/oauth2/auth?"
"client_id=...&redirect_uri=https://myapp.com/oauth/"
"callback&response_type=code&scope=email\",\n"
"    // Hard host-level allowlist — blocked at the native delegate\n"
"    // without round-tripping into TS. Exact match or subdomain match\n"
"    // (so \"google.com\" allows \"accounts.google.com\").\n"
"    allowedDomains: [\"accounts.google.com\", \"google.com\", "
"\"myapp.com\"],\n"
"    onShouldNavigate: (url) => {\n"
"        if (url.startsWith(\"https://myapp.com/oauth/callback?\")) {\n"
"            const code = new URL(url).searchParams.get(\"code\") ?? \"\"\n"
"            authCode.set(code)\n"
"            return false  // cancel — we already have what we need\n"
"        }\n"
"        return true\n"
"    },\n"
"    onLoaded: (url) => {\n"
"        // Fires after every successful page load.\n"
"    },\n"
"    onError: (code, message) => {\n"
"        // DNS / TLS / HTTP / cancellation all flow here.\n"
"    },\n"
"})\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```ts\n"
"const authCode = State(\"\")\n"
"\n"
"const auth = WebView({\n"
"    url: \"https://accounts.google.com/o/oauth2/auth?"
"client_id=...&redirect_uri=https://myapp.com/oauth/"
"callback&response_type=code&scope=email\",\n"
"    // Hard host-level allowlist — blocked at the native delegate\n"
"    // without round-tripping into TS. Exact match or subdomain match\n"
"    // (so \"google.com\" allows \"accounts.google.com\").\n"
"    allowedDomains: [\"accounts.google.com\", \"google.com\", "
"\"myapp.com\"],\n"
"    onShouldNavigate: (url) => {\n"
"        if (url.startsWith(\"https://myapp.com/oauth/callback?\")) {\n"
"            const code = new URL(url).searchParams.get(\"code\") ?? \"\"\n"
"            authCode.set(code)\n"
"            return false  // cancel — we already have what we need\n"
"        }\n"
"        return true\n"
"    },\n"
"    onLoaded: (url) => {\n"
"        // Fires after every successful page load.\n"
"    },\n"
"    onError: (code, message) => {\n"
"        // DNS / TLS / HTTP / cancellation all flow here.\n"
"    },\n"
"})\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/webview.md:87
msgid ""
"The `allowedDomains` allowlist is enforced at the **native delegate layer** "
"— disallowed hosts never reach your `onShouldNavigate`. Treat it as defense-"
"in-depth against a hijacked OAuth page redirecting the embedded session "
"somewhere unexpected."
msgstr ""
"`allowedDomains` 허용 목록은 **네이티브 델리게이트 계층**에서 적용됩니다. 허"
"용되지 않은 호스트는 `onShouldNavigate`에 도달하지 않습니다. 이를 심층 방어"
"로 활용하여, 하이재킹된 OAuth 페이지가 임베디드 세션을 예상치 못한 곳으로 리"
"다이렉트하는 것을 방지하세요."

