#: src/tui/examples.md:119
msgid ""
"The key insight is `inputRef` as the canonical buffer: when the user types "
"fast (or pastes), many bytes arrive in one frame; the handler fires N times "
"with the same stale `input` if it lived in `useState`. `useRef.set()` "
"mutates the cell directly, so each byte builds on the previous; the "
"throwaway `redraw` `useState` just flips `STATE_DIRTY` so the loop repaints."
msgstr ""
"`inputRef`를 표준 버퍼로 사용하는 것이 핵심입니다. 사용자가 빠르게 타이핑하거"
"나 붙여넣기를 할 때, 한 프레임에 여러 바이트가 도착할 수 있습니다. 해당 값이 "
"`useState`에 있었다면 핸들러가 동일한 오래된 `input`으로 N번 실행됩니다. "
"`useRef.set()`은 셀을 직접 변경하므로 각 바이트가 이전 바이트 위에 쌓이고, 일"
"회성 `redraw` `useState`는 단순히 `STATE_DIRTY`를 뒤집어 루프가 다시 그리도"
"록 합니다."

#: src/tui/examples.md:121
msgid "Multi-step prompt with `useFocus`"
msgstr "`useFocus`를 사용한 다단계 프롬프트"

#: src/tui/examples.md:123
msgid ""
"A two-field form (name, email) with Tab/Shift-Tab navigation. Demonstrates "
"`useFocus` with `autoFocus` + the automatic Tab cycling."
msgstr ""
"Tab/Shift-Tab 탐색이 있는 두 필드 폼(이름, 이메일)입니다. `autoFocus`와 함께 "
"`useFocus`를 사용하는 방법과 자동 Tab 순환을 보여줍니다."

#: src/tui/examples.md:125
msgid ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import { Box, Text, useState, useFocus, useInput, run, exit } from \"perry/"
"tui\";\n"
"\n"
"run(() => {\n"
"    const nameFocused = useFocus(1, 1);  // auto-focus first\n"
"    const emailFocused = useFocus(0, 1);\n"
"\n"
"    const [name, setName] = useState(\"\");\n"
"    const [email, setEmail] = useState(\"\");\n"
"\n"
"    useInput((s: string) => {\n"
"        if (s === \"\\x03\") exit();\n"
"        // Tab/Shift-Tab handled by the runtime — we don't see them here\n"
"        // unless we want to (they DO get dispatched after focus cycles).\n"
"        if (s.length === 1 && s >= \" \" && s <= \"~\") {\n"
"            if (nameFocused) setName(name + s);\n"
"            else if (emailFocused) setEmail(email + s);\n"
"        }\n"
"    });\n"
"\n"
"    return Box({ flexDirection: \"column\", padding: 1, gap: 1 }, [\n"
"        Box({ flexDirection: \"row\" }, [\n"
"            Text(nameFocused ? \"▸ \" : \"  \", { color: \"cyan\" }),\n"
"            Text(\"Name:  \" + name),\n"
"        ]),\n"
"        Box({ flexDirection: \"row\" }, [\n"
"            Text(emailFocused ? \"▸ \" : \"  \", { color: \"cyan\" }),\n"
"            Text(\"Email: \" + email),\n"
"        ]),\n"
"        Text(\"Tab to switch · Ctrl+C to quit\", { dimColor: true }),\n"
"    ]);\n"
"});\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import { Box, Text, useState, useFocus, useInput, run, exit } from \"perry/"
"tui\";\n"
"\n"
"run(() => {\n"
"    const nameFocused = useFocus(1, 1);  // auto-focus first\n"
"    const emailFocused = useFocus(0, 1);\n"
"\n"
"    const [name, setName] = useState(\"\");\n"
"    const [email, setEmail] = useState(\"\");\n"
"\n"
"    useInput((s: string) => {\n"
"        if (s === \"\\x03\") exit();\n"
"        // Tab/Shift-Tab handled by the runtime — we don't see them here\n"
"        // unless we want to (they DO get dispatched after focus cycles).\n"
"        if (s.length === 1 && s >= \" \" && s <= \"~\") {\n"
"            if (nameFocused) setName(name + s);\n"
"            else if (emailFocused) setEmail(email + s);\n"
"        }\n"
"    });\n"
"\n"
"    return Box({ flexDirection: \"column\", padding: 1, gap: 1 }, [\n"
"        Box({ flexDirection: \"row\" }, [\n"
"            Text(nameFocused ? \"▸ \" : \"  \", { color: \"cyan\" }),\n"
"            Text(\"Name:  \" + name),\n"
"        ]),\n"
"        Box({ flexDirection: \"row\" }, [\n"
"            Text(emailFocused ? \"▸ \" : \"  \", { color: \"cyan\" }),\n"
"            Text(\"Email: \" + email),\n"
"        ]),\n"
"        Text(\"Tab to switch · Ctrl+C to quit\", { dimColor: true }),\n"
"    ]);\n"
"});\n"
"```"

#: src/tui/examples.md:159
msgid "Log viewer with `useStdout`"
msgstr "`useStdout`를 사용한 로그 뷰어"

#: src/tui/examples.md:161
msgid ""
"Sizes content to the terminal width using `useStdout().columns()`. Truncates "
"each log line to fit; uses `useEffect` with `[]` to seed log data on mount."
msgstr ""
"`useStdout().columns()`를 사용하여 터미널 너비에 맞게 콘텐츠 크기를 조정합니"
"다. 각 로그 라인을 맞게 잘라내고, `[]`와 함께 `useEffect`를 사용하여 마운트 "
"시 로그 데이터를 초기화합니다."

#: src/tui/examples.md:163
msgid ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import { Box, Text, useState, useEffect, useStdout, useInput, run, exit } "
"from \"perry/tui\";\n"
"\n"
"run(() => {\n"
"    const stdout = useStdout();\n"
"    const cols = stdout.columns();\n"
"    const [lines, setLines] = useState([] as string[]);\n"
"\n"
"    useEffect(() => {\n"
"        setLines([\n"
"            \"2026-05-11 09:01:23 INFO  api-east started\",\n"
"            \"2026-05-11 09:01:24 INFO  api-west started\",\n"
"            \"2026-05-11 09:01:25 WARN  api-east latency degraded (412ms)"
"\",\n"
"            \"2026-05-11 09:01:26 ERROR api-east connection refused\",\n"
"        ]);\n"
"    }, []);\n"
"\n"
"    useInput((s: string) => {\n"
"        if (s === \"q\" || s === \"\\x03\") exit();\n"
"    });\n"
"\n"
"    const rows = lines.map((line: string) => {\n"
"        const truncated = line.length > cols - 2 ? line.substring(0, cols - "
"5) + \"...\" : line;\n"
"        const color = line.indexOf(\"ERROR\") >= 0 ? \"red\"\n"
"                    : line.indexOf(\"WARN\") >= 0 ? \"yellow\"\n"
"                    : \"white\";\n"
"        return Text(truncated, { color });\n"
"    });\n"
"\n"
"    return Box({ flexDirection: \"column\", padding: 1 }, rows);\n"
"});\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import { Box, Text, useState, useEffect, useStdout, useInput, run, exit } "
"from \"perry/tui\";\n"
"\n"
"run(() => {\n"
"    const stdout = useStdout();\n"
"    const cols = stdout.columns();\n"
"    const [lines, setLines] = useState([] as string[]);\n"
"\n"
"    useEffect(() => {\n"
"        setLines([\n"
"            \"2026-05-11 09:01:23 INFO  api-east started\",\n"
"            \"2026-05-11 09:01:24 INFO  api-west started\",\n"
"            \"2026-05-11 09:01:25 WARN  api-east latency degraded (412ms)"
"\",\n"
"            \"2026-05-11 09:01:26 ERROR api-east connection refused\",\n"
"        ]);\n"
"    }, []);\n"
"\n"
"    useInput((s: string) => {\n"
"        if (s === \"q\" || s === \"\\x03\") exit();\n"
"    });\n"
"\n"
"    const rows = lines.map((line: string) => {\n"
"        const truncated = line.length > cols - 2 ? line.substring(0, cols - "
"5) + \"...\" : line;\n"
"        const color = line.indexOf(\"ERROR\") >= 0 ? \"red\"\n"
"                    : line.indexOf(\"WARN\") >= 0 ? \"yellow\"\n"
"                    : \"white\";\n"
"        return Text(truncated, { color });\n"
"    });\n"
"\n"
"    return Box({ flexDirection: \"column\", padding: 1 }, rows);\n"
"});\n"
"```"

