"Microsoft redistributable license. Pass `--accept-license` to skip the "
"prompt in CI. Partial downloads resume safely on re-run."
msgstr ""
"`perry setup windows`는 Microsoft 재배포 라이선스 동의를 묻고 `%LOCALAPPDATA%"
