#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:5
msgid ""
"**Status:** the full `Widget({...})` snippets on this page compile-link "
"cleanly on the host LLVM target via [`docs/examples/widgets/snippets.ts`]"
"(https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/blob/main/docs/examples/widgets/"
"snippets.ts), so the API shapes are verified against the codegen. The actual "
"cross-compile targets (`--target ios-widget`/`android-widget`/`watchos-"
"widget`/`wearos-tile`) can be driven by the doc-tests harness with a `// "
"widget-bundle-id:` banner ([\\#194](https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/issues/"
"194)). These shared snippets do not request those targets, so their regular "
"CI coverage remains the host compile/link path; SDK-backed target coverage "
"runs only where the required Xcode or Android toolchain is installed. For "
"the canonical end-to-end shape see [`examples/widget_demo.ts`](https://"
"github.com/PerryTS/perry/blob/main/examples/widget_demo.ts). Fragments below "
"that show partial syntax (just the `entryFields` object, just a `render:` "
"body, etc.) are rendered as plain text — the full declarations they appear "
"inside are covered by the verified anchors."
msgstr ""
"**상태:** 전체 `Widget({...})` 이 페이지의 단편들은 호스트에서 깔끔하게 컴파"
"일-링크됩니다 LLVM 타겟을 통해 [`docs/examples/widgets/snippets.ts`](https://"
"github.com/PerryTS/perry/blob/main/docs/examples/widgets/snippets.ts), 그래"
"서 API 형태는 코딩에 의해 검증됩니다. 실제 크로스 컴파일 타겟 (`--target ios-"
"widget`/`android-widget`/`watchos-widget`/`wearos-tile`) 은 `// widget-"
"bundle-id:` 배너 ([\\#194](https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/issues/194)) 를 "
"가진 doc-test harness에 의해 작동될 수 있습니다. 이 공유 스니펫은 해당 타겟"
"을 요청하지 않으므로, 그들의 일반적인 CI 커버리지는 호스트 compile/link 경로"
"로 유지됩니다. SDK가 지원하는 타겟 커버리지는 필요한 Xcode 또는 Android 툴 체"
"인이 설치된 경우에만 실행됩니다. 종말부터 종말까지의 정규 형태에 대해서는 "
"[`examples/widget_demo.ts`](https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/blob/main/"
"examples/widget_demo.ts)를 참조하십시오. 부분적인 문법을 보여주는 아래의 조"
"각 (`entryFields` 객체, `render:` 본체, 등) 은 일반 텍스트로 표시됩니다."

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:21
msgid "Widget Declaration"
msgstr "위젯 선언"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:23
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"Widget({\n"
"    kind: \"WeatherWidget\",\n"
"    displayName: \"Weather\",\n"
"    description: \"Shows current weather\",\n"
"    entryFields: {\n"
"        temperature: \"number\",\n"
"        condition: \"string\",\n"
"        location: \"string\",\n"
"    },\n"
"    render: (entry) =>\n"
"        VStack([\n"
"            HStack([\n"
"                Text(entry.location),\n"
"                Spacer(),\n"
"                Image(\"cloud.sun.fill\"),\n"
"            ]),\n"
"            Text(`${entry.temperature}°`),\n"
"            Text(entry.condition),\n"
"        ]),\n"
"})\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"Widget({\n"
"    kind: \"WeatherWidget\",\n"
"    displayName: \"Weather\",\n"
"    description: \"Shows current weather\",\n"
"    entryFields: {\n"
"        temperature: \"number\",\n"
"        condition: \"string\",\n"
"        location: \"string\",\n"
"    },\n"
"    render: (entry) =>\n"
"        VStack([\n"
"            HStack([\n"
"                Text(entry.location),\n"
"                Spacer(),\n"
"                Image(\"cloud.sun.fill\"),\n"
"            ]),\n"
"            Text(`${entry.temperature}°`),\n"
"            Text(entry.condition),\n"
"        ]),\n"
"})\n"
"```"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:46
