#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:59
msgid "Entry Fields"
msgstr "엔트리 필드"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:61
msgid ""
"Entry fields define the data your widget displays. Each field has a name and "
"type:"
msgstr ""
"엔트리 필드는 위젯이 표시하는 데이터를 정의합니다. 각 필드에는 이름과 타입이 "
"있습니다:"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:63
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"entryFields: {\n"
"  title: \"string\",\n"
"  count: \"number\",\n"
"  isActive: \"boolean\",\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"entryFields: {\n"
"  title: \"string\",\n"
"  count: \"number\",\n"
"  isActive: \"boolean\",\n"
"}\n"
"```"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:71
msgid "Array, Optional, and Object Fields"
msgstr "배열, 옵셔널, 객체 필드"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:73
msgid "Entry fields support richer types beyond primitives:"
msgstr "엔트리 필드는 원시 타입을 넘어 더 풍부한 타입을 지원합니다:"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:75
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"entryFields: {\n"
"  items: [{ name: \"string\", value: \"number\" }],  // Array of objects\n"
"  subtitle: \"string?\",                             // Optional string\n"
"  stats: { wins: \"number\", losses: \"number\" },     // Nested object\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"entryFields: {\n"
"  items: [{ name: \"string\", value: \"number\" }],  // Array of objects\n"
"  subtitle: \"string?\",                             // Optional string\n"
"  stats: { wins: \"number\", losses: \"number\" },     // Nested object\n"
"}\n"
"```"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:83
msgid "These compile to a Swift `TimelineEntry` struct:"
msgstr "이는 Swift의 `TimelineEntry` 구조체로 컴파일됩니다:"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:94
msgid "Conditionals in Render"
msgstr "렌더에서의 조건부 처리"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:96
msgid "Use ternary expressions for conditional rendering:"
msgstr "조건부 렌더링에는 삼항 표현식을 사용하세요:"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:98
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"Widget({\n"
"    kind: \"ConditionalWidget\",\n"
"    displayName: \"Conditional\",\n"
"    description: \"Renders based on entry data\",\n"
"    entryFields: {\n"
"        isActive: \"boolean\",\n"
"        count: \"number\",\n"
"    },\n"
"    render: (entry) =>\n"
"        VStack([\n"
"            Text(entry.isActive ? \"Active\" : \"Inactive\"),\n"
"            entry.count > 0 ? Text(`${entry.count} items`) : Spacer(),\n"
"        ]),\n"
"})\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"Widget({\n"
"    kind: \"ConditionalWidget\",\n"
"    displayName: \"Conditional\",\n"
"    description: \"Renders based on entry data\",\n"
"    entryFields: {\n"
"        isActive: \"boolean\",\n"
"        count: \"number\",\n"
"    },\n"
"    render: (entry) =>\n"
"        VStack([\n"
"            Text(entry.isActive ? \"Active\" : \"Inactive\"),\n"
"            entry.count > 0 ? Text(`${entry.count} items`) : Spacer(),\n"
"        ]),\n"
"})\n"
"```"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:117
msgid ""
"Template literals in widget text are compiled to Swift string interpolation:"
msgstr "위젯 텍스트의 템플릿 리터럴은 Swift 문자열 보간으로 컴파일됩니다:"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:119
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"Widget({\n"
"    kind: \"TemplateLiteralWidget\",\n"
"    displayName: \"Template Literal\",\n"
"    description: \"Template literals compile to Swift string "
"interpolation\",\n"
"    entryFields: {\n"
"        name: \"string\",\n"
"        score: \"number\",\n"
"    },\n"
"    render: (entry) =>\n"
"        // Template literal: `${entry.name}: ${entry.score} points`\n"
"        // Compiles to: Text(\"\\(entry.name): \\(entry.score) points\")\n"
"        Text(`${entry.name}: ${entry.score} points`),\n"
"})\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"Widget({\n"
"    kind: \"TemplateLiteralWidget\",\n"
"    displayName: \"Template Literal\",\n"
"    description: \"Template literals compile to Swift string "
"interpolation\",\n"
"    entryFields: {\n"
"        name: \"string\",\n"
"        score: \"number\",\n"
"    },\n"
"    render: (entry) =>\n"
"        // Template literal: `${entry.name}: ${entry.score} points`\n"
"        // Compiles to: Text(\"\\(entry.name): \\(entry.score) points\")\n"
"        Text(`${entry.name}: ${entry.score} points`),\n"
"})\n"
"```"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:135
msgid "Configuration Parameters"
msgstr "구성 매개변수"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:137
msgid ""
"The `config` field defines user-editable parameters that appear in the "
"widget's edit UI:"
msgstr ""
"`config` 필드는 위젯의 편집 UI에 표시되는 사용자 편집 가능한 매개변수를 정의"
"합니다:"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:139
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"Widget({\n"
"    kind: \"CityWeather\",\n"
"    displayName: \"City Weather\",\n"
"    description: \"Weather for a chosen city\",\n"
"    config: {\n"
"        city: { type: \"string\", displayName: \"City\", default: \"New "
"York\" },\n"
"        units: {\n"
"            type: \"enum\",\n"
"            displayName: \"Units\",\n"
"            values: [\"Celsius\", \"Fahrenheit\"],\n"
"            default: \"Celsius\",\n"
"        },\n"
"    },\n"
"    entryFields: { temperature: \"number\", condition: \"string\" },\n"
"    render: (entry) => Text(`${entry.temperature}° ${entry.condition}`),\n"
"})\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"Widget({\n"
"    kind: \"CityWeather\",\n"
"    displayName: \"City Weather\",\n"
"    description: \"Weather for a chosen city\",\n"
"    config: {\n"
"        city: { type: \"string\", displayName: \"City\", default: \"New "
"York\" },\n"
"        units: {\n"
"            type: \"enum\",\n"
"            displayName: \"Units\",\n"
"            values: [\"Celsius\", \"Fahrenheit\"],\n"
"            default: \"Celsius\",\n"
"        },\n"
"    },\n"
"    entryFields: { temperature: \"number\", condition: \"string\" },\n"
"    render: (entry) => Text(`${entry.temperature}° ${entry.condition}`),\n"
"})\n"
"```"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:158
msgid "Provider Function"
msgstr "프로바이더 함수"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:160
msgid ""
"The `provider` field defines a timeline provider that fetches data for the "
"widget:"
msgstr ""
"`provider` 필드는 위젯을 위한 데이터를 가져오는 타임라인 프로바이더를 정의합"
"니다:"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:162
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"Widget({\n"
"    kind: \"StockWidget\",\n"
"    displayName: \"Stock Price\",\n"
"    description: \"Shows current stock price\",\n"
"    config: {\n"
"        symbol: { type: \"string\", displayName: \"Symbol\", default: "
"\"AAPL\" },\n"
"    },\n"
"    entryFields: { price: \"number\", change: \"string\" },\n"
"    provider: async (config) => {\n"
"        const res = await fetch(`https://api.example.com/stock/$"
"{config.symbol}`)\n"
"        const data = await res.json()\n"
"        return { price: data.price, change: data.change }\n"
"    },\n"
"    // Inline-options form — the chain form `.font(\"title\")` parses but "
"is\n"
"    // dropped at HIR-lowering time (#195).\n"
"    render: (entry) =>\n"
"        VStack([\n"
"            Text(`$${entry.price}`, { font: \"title\" }),\n"
"            Text(entry.change, { color: \"green\" }),\n"
"        ]),\n"
"})\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"Widget({\n"
"    kind: \"StockWidget\",\n"
"    displayName: \"Stock Price\",\n"
"    description: \"Shows current stock price\",\n"
"    config: {\n"
"        symbol: { type: \"string\", displayName: \"Symbol\", default: "
"\"AAPL\" },\n"
"    },\n"
"    entryFields: { price: \"number\", change: \"string\" },\n"
"    provider: async (config) => {\n"
"        const res = await fetch(`https://api.example.com/stock/$"
"{config.symbol}`)\n"
"        const data = await res.json()\n"
"        return { price: data.price, change: data.change }\n"
"    },\n"
"    // Inline-options form — the chain form `.font(\"title\")` parses but "
"is\n"
"    // dropped at HIR-lowering time (#195).\n"
"    render: (entry) =>\n"
"        VStack([\n"
"            Text(`$${entry.price}`, { font: \"title\" }),\n"
"            Text(entry.change, { color: \"green\" }),\n"
"        ]),\n"
"})\n"
"```"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:186
msgid ""
"Note: chain-style modifiers (`.font(\"title\").color(\"green\")`) are "
"rejected with a compile-time diagnostic so styling cannot disappear "
"silently; this behavior closed [\\#195](https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/"
"issues/195). The verified extract uses the supported inline-options form "
"`Text(\"...\", { font: \"title\" })`."
msgstr ""
"참고: 체인 스타일 수정자 (`.font(\"title\").color(\"green\")`) 는 컴파일 시"
"간 진단으로 거부되므로 스타일링이 조용히 사라질 수 없습니다. 이 행동은 "
"[\\#195](https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/issues/195)를 닫았습니다. 검증된 추"
"출은 지원되는 `Text(\"...\", { font: \"title\" })` 인라인 옵션 양식을 사용합"
"니다."

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:192
msgid "Placeholder Data"
msgstr "플레이스홀더 데이터"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:194
msgid ""
"When the widget has no data yet (e.g., first load), the provider can return "
"placeholder data by providing a `placeholder` field:"
msgstr ""
"위젯에 아직 데이터가 없을 때(예: 첫 로드 시) 프로바이더는 `placeholder` 필드"
"를 제공하여 플레이스홀더 데이터를 반환할 수 있습니다:"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:196
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"Widget({\n"
"  kind: \"NewsWidget\",\n"
"  entryFields: { headline: \"string\", source: \"string\" },\n"
"  placeholder: { headline: \"Loading...\", source: \"---\" },\n"
"  // ...\n"
"});\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"Widget({\n"
"  kind: \"NewsWidget\",\n"
"  entryFields: { headline: \"string\", source: \"string\" },\n"
"  placeholder: { headline: \"Loading...\", source: \"---\" },\n"
"  // ...\n"
"});\n"
"```"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:205
msgid "Family-Specific Rendering"
msgstr "Family별 렌더링"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:207
msgid ""
"The render function accepts an optional second parameter for the widget "
"family, allowing different layouts per size:"
msgstr ""
"렌더 함수는 위젯 family를 위한 선택적 두 번째 매개변수를 받아 크기별로 다른 "
"레이아웃을 적용할 수 있습니다:"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:209
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"render: (entry, family) =>\n"
"  family === \"systemLarge\"\n"
"    ? VStack([\n"
"        Text(entry.title).font(\"title\"),\n"
"        ForEach(entry.items, (item) => Text(item.name)),\n"
"      ])\n"
"    : HStack([\n"
"        Image(\"star.fill\"),\n"
"        Text(entry.title).font(\"headline\"),\n"
"      ]),\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"render: (entry, family) =>\n"
"  family === \"systemLarge\"\n"
"    ? VStack([\n"
"        Text(entry.title).font(\"title\"),\n"
"        ForEach(entry.items, (item) => Text(item.name)),\n"
"      ])\n"
"    : HStack([\n"
"        Image(\"star.fill\"),\n"
"        Text(entry.title).font(\"headline\"),\n"
"      ]),\n"
"```"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:222
msgid ""
"Supported families: `\"systemSmall\"`, `\"systemMedium\"`, "
"`\"systemLarge\"`, `\"accessoryCircular\"`, `\"accessoryRectangular\"`, "
"`\"accessoryInline\"`."
msgstr ""
"지원되는 family: `\"systemSmall\"`, `\"systemMedium\"`, `\"systemLarge\"`, "
"`\"accessoryCircular\"`, `\"accessoryRectangular\"`, `\"accessoryInline\"`."

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:224
msgid "App Group"
msgstr "App Group"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:226
msgid ""
"The `appGroup` field specifies a shared container for data exchange between "
"the host app and the widget:"
msgstr ""
"`appGroup` 필드는 호스트 앱과 위젯 간 데이터 교환을 위한 공유 컨테이너를 지정"
"합니다:"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:228
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"Widget({\n"
"  kind: \"AppDataWidget\",\n"
"  appGroup: \"group.com.example.myapp\",\n"
"  // ...\n"
"});\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"Widget({\n"
"  kind: \"AppDataWidget\",\n"
"  appGroup: \"group.com.example.myapp\",\n"
"  // ...\n"
"});\n"
"```"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:236
msgid "Multiple Widgets"
msgstr "다중 위젯"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:238
msgid ""
"Define multiple widgets in a single file. They're bundled into a "
"`WidgetBundle`:"
msgstr ""
"단일 파일에 여러 위젯을 정의할 수 있습니다. 이들은 `WidgetBundle`로 번들링됩"
"니다:"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:240
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"Widget({\n"
"  kind: \"SmallWidget\",\n"
"  // ...\n"
"});\n"
"\n"
"Widget({\n"
"  kind: \"LargeWidget\",\n"
"  // ...\n"
"});\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"Widget({\n"
"  kind: \"SmallWidget\",\n"
"  // ...\n"
"});\n"
"\n"
"Widget({\n"
"  kind: \"LargeWidget\",\n"
"  // ...\n"
"});\n"
"```"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:254
msgid "[Components](components.md) — Available widget components and modifiers"
msgstr "[Components](components.md) — 사용 가능한 위젯 컴포넌트와 수정자"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:255 src/widgets/components.md:262
msgid "[Overview](overview.md) — Widget system overview"
msgstr "[Overview](overview.md) — 위젯 시스템 개요"

#: src/widgets/components.md:1
msgid "Widget Components & Modifiers"
msgstr "위젯 컴포넌트 및 수정자"

#: src/widgets/components.md:3
msgid "Available components and modifiers for widgets."
msgstr "위젯에서 사용할 수 있는 컴포넌트와 수정자입니다."

#: src/widgets/components.md:5
msgid ""
"**Status:** this page mixes (a) tiny fragments showing component shape — "
"rendered as plain `text` because they're not standalone declarations and "
"can't compile — and (b) one full verified Widget at the bottom that compile-"
"links via [`docs/examples/widgets/snippets.ts`](https://github.com/PerryTS/"
"perry/blob/main/docs/examples/widgets/snippets.ts). The doc-tests harness "
"can pass `--app-bundle-id` from a `// widget-bundle-id:` banner ([\\#194]"
"(https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/issues/194)); end-to-end targets also "
"require their platform SDK. Modifier syntax is deliberately limited to "
"**inline option-object arguments** — e.g. `Text(\"hi\", { font: \"title\", "
"color: \"red\" })` and `VStack([...], { padding: 16 })`. Method-style chains "
"such as `Text(\"hi\").font(\"title\")` are rejected with an actionable "
"compile-time diagnostic instead of being silently ignored; that behavior "
"closed [\\#195](https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/issues/195). The end-to-end "
"reference is [`examples/widget_demo.ts`](https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/"
"blob/main/examples/widget_demo.ts)."
msgstr ""
"**상태:** 이 페이지에는 (a) 구성 요소 모양 을 보여주는 작은 파편이 을 혼합하"
"고 있습니다. `text`로 표시된 것은 독립적인 선언이 아니기 때문에 을 컴파일할 "
"수 없기 때문입니다. 그리고 (b) [`docs/examples/widgets/snippets.ts`](https://"
"github.com/PerryTS/perry/blob/main/docs/examples/widgets/snippets.ts)를 통해 "
"컴파일 링크를 제공하는 아래쪽에 있는 하나의 완전한 검증된 위젯이 있습니다. "
"doc-tester harness는 `// widget-bundle-id:` 배너 ([\\#194](https://"
"github.com/PerryTS/perry/issues/194)) 에서 `--app-bundle-id`를 전달할 수 있습"
"니다. 엔드-투-엔드 타겟은 또한 플랫폼 SDK를 필요로 합니다. 수정자 문법은 의도"
"적으로 **인라인 옵션 객체 논증** — e.g. `Text(\"hi\", { font: \"title\", "
"color: \"red\" })`와 `VStack([...], { padding: 16 })` "
"`Text(\"hi\").font(\"title\")`와 같은 메소드 스타일의 체인은 침묵으로 무시되"
"는 대신 실행 가능한 컴파일 시간 진단으로 거부됩니다. 그 행동은 [\\#195]"
"(https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/issues/195)를 닫습니다. 끝에서 끝까지 참조"
"하는 것은 [`examples/widget_demo.ts`](https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/blob/"
"main/examples/widget_demo.ts)입니다."

