msgstr "실패: 굶주림 (#7856)"

#: src/testing/ci-gate-scheduling.md:12
msgid ""
"On 2026-08-11, **every** heavy gate in this repo had produced zero results "
"on `main` for over two days. They were not failing and not cancelled. They "
"never reached a runner."
msgstr ""
