#: src/cli/perry-toml.md:132
msgid "`[app]`"
msgstr "`[app]`"

#: src/cli/perry-toml.md:134
msgid ""
"Alternative to `[project]` with identical fields. Useful for organizational "
"clarity — `[app]` takes precedence over `[project]` when both are present:"
msgstr ""
"동일한 필드를 가진 `[project]`의 대안입니다. 조직적 명확성에 유용합니다 — 둘 "
"다 있는 경우 `[app]`이 `[project]`보다 우선합니다:"

#: src/cli/perry-toml.md:136
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"# These two are equivalent:\n"
"[project]\n"
"name = \"my-app\"\n"
"\n"
"# or:\n"
"[app]\n"
"name = \"my-app\"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```toml\n"
"# These two are equivalent:\n"
"[project]\n"
"name = \"my-app\"\n"
"\n"
"# or:\n"
"[app]\n"
"name = \"my-app\"\n"
"```"

#: src/cli/perry-toml.md:146
msgid ""
"When both exist, resolution order is: `[app]` field -> `[project]` field -> "
"default."
msgstr ""
"둘 다 존재하는 경우 해결 순서는: `[app]` 필드 -> `[project]` 필드 -> 기본값입"
"니다."

#: src/cli/perry-toml.md:148
msgid ""
"`[app]` supports the same fields as `[project]`: `name`, `version`, "
"`build_number`, `bundle_id`, `description`, `entry`, and `icons`."
msgstr ""
"`[app]`은 `[project]`와 동일한 필드를 지원합니다: `name`, `version`, "
"`build_number`, `bundle_id`, `description`, `entry`, `icons`."

