"_value_and_generation_tested`, `emit_jsvalue_slot_store_pointer_tested`) "
"must pass a string-literal stem, and the census in `crates/perry-codegen/src/"
"expr/barrier_stem_census_tests.rs` (`VERIFIED_BARRIER_STEMS`) must list "
"exactly that stem set — the lint script fails on drift in either direction, "
"on a stem it cannot resolve to a literal, and on a `BARRIERED` marker in any "
"codegen file not bound to a census stem. The census test itself (a `--lib` "
"test, so per-PR) compiles a probe per stem and, for **every instance** of "
"the stem's gate in the emitted IR, asserts a `cond_br` into `<stem>.barrier."
