#: src/internals/local-binding-type-evidence.md:85
msgid "Each inventory group states one of three verdicts:"
msgstr "각 재고 그룹은 세 가지 판결 중 하나를 명시합니다"

#: src/internals/local-binding-type-evidence.md:87
